      "text": "目标预测头与价值预测头解耦",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "目标预测头与价值预测头解耦",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mg-LEsEebtEawnuuVhwEC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 654.7716648161713,
      "y": 2443.2691610316683,
      "width": 1058.7637671478599,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 987400965,
      "version": 270,
      "versionNonce": 639017547,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "放弃奖励的绝对量级（Magnitude），只保留其符号与相对顺序。将全世界的奖励粗暴地映射到{-1，1}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "放弃奖励的绝对量级（Magnitude），只保留其符号与相对顺序。将全世界的奖励粗暴地映射到{-1，1}",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b52q1tf3B1tC6eT5KODBR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660.8841646024275,
      "y": 2483.2605742394276,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1675572069,
      "version": 269,
      "versionNonce": 1598169323,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "注：后期有更多优化方式，因为裁剪会丢失精细语义",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "注：后期有更多优化方式，因为裁剪会丢失精细语义",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YX5l1ezVLs6fYQQp1xQRY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 374.9777448789539,
      "y": 2603.5482938983673,
      "width": 845.4393920898438,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 425504133,
      "version": 268,
      "versionNonce": 1875168139,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RL is a very random exploration process. Successful experiences may be extremely rare.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RL is a very random exploration process. Successful experiences may be extremely rare.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LT5C_K_cAFGZBaa3fQSw3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 486.1286670861057,
      "y": 2672.7868224770245,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1430965099,
      "version": 230,
      "versionNonce": 1004085803,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "网络权重随机初始化，一开始表现极烂，导致采集到的数据全是失败的（负奖励）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "网络权重随机初始化，一开始表现极烂，导致采集到的数据全是失败的（负奖励）。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gCinXai8cmnj9ULp1ODil",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 482.0926470407285,
      "y": 2718.5151273259326,
      "width": 476.79998779296875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 304755909,
      "version": 292,
      "versionNonce": 1013556427,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在线学习拿着这些“失败数据”做梯度下降，更新权重。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在线学习拿着这些“失败数据”做梯度下降，更新权重。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7efuy0u6_-OhOfP5IhrYt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 487.5448783013471,
      "y": 2778.1567157689115,
      "width": 820.6908013089588,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 609494539,
      "version": 265,
      "versionNonce": 1762710379,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "权重更新后，策略变得更差了（因为只学了失败数据），于是接下来采集到的数据更加失败。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "权重更新后，策略变得更差了（因为只学了失败数据），于是接下来采集到的数据更加失败。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9_6nlj5iCpp2vEOhMHs0b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 486.22040223996123,
      "y": 2833.8936400886055,
      "width": 931.134770357899,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 384914469,
      "version": 327,
      "versionNonce": 1645817355,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "再拿这些更失败的数据去训练……网络彻底崩塌（坍缩到局部极小值），再也无法探索到成功的路径。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "再拿这些更失败的数据去训练……网络彻底崩塌（坍缩到局部极小值），再也无法探索到成功的路径。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MFyx1DHk_i-sQ-Nfa5F_g",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1259.3033064243518,
      "y": 2603.5411600238626,
      "width": 411.215576171875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 977400933,
      "version": 309,
      "versionNonce": 1518154923,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rare success → must repeatedly review it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rare success → must repeatedly review it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
